Provides detailed information on SSID, Frequency, Band, Channel, Signal Strength,
Bitrate/Speed, Throughput, Security, Hardware, IP/Routing, Packet Statistics,
Channel Congestion Advisor, Mesh/Roaming Monitor, Jitter Stress Testing,
and Real-time Walk-test Logging.
"""

